ts - Or take on the INFINIDUNGEON for neverending battles and rewards!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Optimize your character with unique skills and upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Craft dozens of items and vehicles to prepare for the treacherous wilderness</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1658150/extras/a15839182fff8f7be76279a8e17b284f.poster.avif?t=1783321708\" width=600 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1658150/extras/a15839182fff8f7be76279a8e17b284f.webm?t=1783321708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1658150/extras/a15839182fff8f7be76279a8e17b284f.mp4?t=1783321708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since we launched on September 20, 2023 we’ve been working hard to add more functionality and fun to the game, including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooking!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >41 new cards!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 50 new and free decorative items!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Marriage!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infinidungeon!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character Customization – Dress your alchemist up in adorable fits to reflect your play!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More QoL improvements than we can count!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1658150/extras/0ed76c682507f4f986246f7a55a961ce.poster.avif?t=1783321708\" wid